# NOTE: docs/consistency-failures.md was ignored here until 2026-08-21, on the
# assumption it is an auto-generated runtime artifact that should start empty on a
# fresh clone. What actually got built is hand-authored, back-filled reflexion
# knowledge that five skills read and that docs/CLAUDE.md registers as the
# project's Reflexion Log — its entire value is surviving across sessions and
# machines. The rule outlived its premise, so it is gone. The file is tracked.

