# === Engine: Godot ===
.godot/
*.translation

# export_presets.cfg is deliberately TRACKED (2026-08-28 manager ruling).
# It was ignored here until an exported build shipped with an empty battlefield:
# include_filter was "" so the .txt data files under assets/data/ were never
# packed, and the game booted with its UI chrome but no board, no terrain and
# no units. The one-line fix lived only on one machine; any fresh clone would
# have re-exported the same broken build, with no error anywhere to explain it.
# Verified 2026-08-28: this file holds no credentials, keystores or signing
# secrets — only export paths, filters and platform options.

# GdUnit4 test reports (regenerated on every run; `reports/report_N/` XML + HTML).
# Added 2026-08-26 when GdUnit4 v6.2.1 was first installed and actually executed.
reports/
