# === Prototype verification evidence (overrides the Unity [Ll]ogs/ rule above) ===
# Spike / cross-check logs under prototypes/ are cited by ADRs as the authoritative
# evidence for engine-behaviour claims, so they MUST be in the repository.
# Added 2026-08-20: commit e5605eb's message said "archive unfiltered cross-check logs"
# but added zero log files — [Ll]ogs/ above had silently swallowed them all.
!prototypes/**/logs/
!prototypes/**/logs/**

# === QA evidence screenshots: the .import companions only ===
# 截圖本身要進版控(它們是 coding-standards.md 要求的 UI 變更驗證證據),
# 但 Godot 會為專案內每個檔案產生 .import 伴隨檔,而這些截圖**從來不會被遊戲載入** ——
# 它們不是素材,那個 .import 純粹是雜訊,而且每次有人跑 --import 就會多出一個。
# 素材本身的 .import 仍然進版控(見上方 Godot 區塊刻意未啟用的 *.import 規則),
# 這裡只排除證據目錄。加於 2026-08-27,第一次出現 evidence/*.png.import 之後。
production/qa/evidence/*.import
